   "MatterHistoryActionName": "elected",
   "MatterHistoryActionText": "The Rules, Confirmations, and Public Elections Committee recommended the nominees. The President called for an election to fill one vacancy on the Human Relations Commission. Nominations previously made were Christy Borthick. The following vote was taken on the nominated candidates: Christy Borthick (21): Allen, Hill, Kimbrough, Cortese, Webb, Eslick, Evans, Bradford, Huffman, Gregg, Cash, Kupin, Taylor, Johnston, Nash, Benton, Ellis, Rutherford, Styles, Ewing, and Spain; Abstain (10): Porterfield, Evans-Segall, Toombs, Gamble, Harrell, Welsch, Vo, Gadd, Preptit, Sepulveda. The president declared that Christy Borthick was elected to the Commission.",
